1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,580
I take the elevator up

2
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:06,820
But it's still a mountain climb

3
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:10,820
And a current runs right through me

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:15,460
Every single time

5
00:00:15,460 --> 00:00:18,420
I'm so charged I zap the railing

6
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:22,420
Like a live wire throwing sparks

7
00:00:22,900 --> 00:00:25,780
Then the doors slide open slowly

8
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:30,900
On a floor I know by heart

9
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:31,800
I'm wearing the clothes of a normal man
